invariant: INV-48
file: mlkem_avx2.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-avx2
reason: the row sampler parses 55 of a block's 56 groups, so each entry
  skips the candidates of every block's last group. Only an x86-64 compiler reads the line, so the script builds
  bin/mlkem_avx2_equiv_test for x86-64 and runs it under
  qemu-x86_64. The lane skips without docker, and this then reports
  unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
            groups = MLK_BLOCK_GROUPS;
--- new
            groups = MLK_BLOCK_GROUPS - 1;
